  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "使用量與現況的證據界線",
      "description": "先呈現資料新鮮度、role／model／token 類型、API USD 與 Codex credits estimate，再把 provider 特有快照放到細節區。",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### 先確認資料新鮮度，再閱讀角色與 token 成本驅動\n\n`agent_role` 與 `model_id` 已分離；unknown model／rate 維持未估價。**API USD estimate** 與 **Codex credits estimate** 使用不同 rate card，兩者都不是實際帳單、訂閱剩餘額度或 Enterprise contract。Cached input 依公開 rate card 折價，**不是免費**；Codex 未公布 cache-write 專屬 credits rate，因此該類型在 credits 視角維持未估價。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Telemetry 距今",
      "description": "最後一筆符合目前 provider／product／role／model 篩選的 token telemetry 距離現在多久；超過 5 分鐘轉黃、15 分鐘轉紅。",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 300
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 900
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": ""
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "time() - max(timestamp(ai_agent_turn_token_usage_sum{ai_agent_provider=~\"$provider\",ai_agent_product=~\"$product\",model_id=~\"$model_id\",agent_role=~\"$agent_role\",service_namespace!~\"^ai-collaboration(-cost|-role)?-fixture$\"}))",
          "legendFormat": "距今秒數",
          "instant": true
        }
      ]
    },
